    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> for H and He are 13.6 eV and 24.6 eV respectively. Thus, energy required in eV during the formation of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mtext>He</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>2+</mtext></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math> by<br />\r<br />\r<math> <mrow> <mtext>He</mtext><mo>→</mo><msup> <mrow> <mtext>He</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>2+</mtext></mrow> </msup> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mrow> <mtext>2e</mtext></mrow> <mo>−</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> is"
  },
